-void InvalidationTracker::HandleMemoryProtectionNotification(uint64_t Address, uint64_t Size, ULONG Prot) {
+/* Vessel: a reservation has no pages in it, so it cannot contain code.
+ *
+ * **This is the root of the 13,864,960-resume loop, and the status code is what
+ * names it.** Measured on the device on a Metro 2033 session, FEX 260806:
+ *
+ *   RWX reprotect FAILED C000002D on page 7E5E616000 (fault 7E5E616608,
+ *   pc 140088F10, occurrence 13864960); the fault is being resumed unrepaired
